{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1ea02f152a53ad67552ced0065741ecdf30822afa68fb736a347c9d43fd9d0c5", "ja": "ついに帰国の日。全力でバカンスを楽しんだ\n3人だったが、肝心の新曲の歌詞は上手く\nまとまらなかった。楽しかった事を全部\n伝えたいという素直な想いを聞き、なら\nそれでいい、と背中を押すプロデューサー。", "zh": "终于到了回国的日子。\n三人虽然尽情享受了假期，\n却难以汇整出关键的新歌歌词。\n三人坦率地表示，她们想把开心的旅程全部写\n进去，制作人闻言便说这样就好，予以支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0eaee711f8fdae8fabe7e3a83c2a9b8a37fecd355096c28871f42fa7ed1f2a37", "ja": "もう帰国か……。\n終わってみれば、あっという間のバカンスだったな。", "zh": "已经要回国了啊……\n等到要结束的时候，才发现度假时光一转眼就过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "868053ced3651702b2449857bf7b8e8cf89df5efdff5e1c07e69a8cf6b2aad57", "ja": "ん～、まるでライブ後みたいな、この充実感！\n南の島を、とことん遊び尽くしたよ！", "zh": "嗯～这种充实感，就好像刚结束演唱会一样！\n我们已经把南国小岛彻底玩遍了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "70aa87a1c219aabef0604edf8f87e18b6784a34649c7f4f4dbc044f8efb2735f", "ja": "うん！　南国のお料理もたくさん堪能できたし……\n帰ったらさっそく、レシピにまとめなくっちゃ！", "zh": "嗯！也品尝了很多南国料理……\n回去后得尽快把食谱整理出来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1bf0444e2a5e26282e210c786834f6f4f8120045b3dc44193520146b4be2844b", "ja": "わたしは、もうちょっといたかったなぁ～。\n美希ちゃんたちは、まだ残るんですよね？", "zh": "我倒是想再多待几天呢～\n美希她们还会继续留在这里对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "78765670be08f18da53eaca30eaca6d20288956bb72a4e07aa046bcd30a37329", "ja": "ああ。今日まで観光する余裕もなかったから、\nすこし羽を伸ばしてから帰ってくるそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，因为她们在今天以前都没有时间观光，\n会稍微在这里放松一下才回去的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "553e33911e7e1bd04914de087128f85fb79efee2abfc01ff327e38cbaf199acc", "ja": "いいな～。美希ちゃんと律子さんとも、\n一緒に遊びたかったなー。", "zh": "真好～\n我也好想跟美希还有律子姊一起玩──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d4562540b5c0cea8478ba6d7c071d017921d3b09fda86de5f09a9b4eab57bcb8", "ja": "あの2人とタイミングが合わなかったのは残念だが……\n翼、それに2人も、大事なことを忘れてないか？", "zh": "可惜我们的时间刚好跟她们两个错开了……\n翼还有二位，还记不记得一件重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f82930ad3c8f73a2c0ee6a9fe9e62afa9c71f45b8f20e56f12930b68247e0fa1", "ja": "大事なこと？", "zh": "重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "496631a7ccc5c5812af0271046d38eaf8f2cc79c700b86bd5d7f7ad66271c24c", "ja": "今回の目的は、新曲の歌詞だろ？\nちゃんと完成しそうか？", "zh": "我们此行的目的是新歌歌词吧？\n感觉有办法写出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9d8b132f4f8634a9136b9e2892c317c6a9649b7764550b2cdcdf352ce12ce32", "ja": "あ！　えっと、それは……。", "zh": "啊！呃，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "3a4a68c046c3e925835741f89a3caed1333108f27b20db9baafbf9508d3ebe18", "ja": "えっと～……ごめん、{$P$}！\nカッコイイ歌詞、全然思いつかなかった！！", "zh": "呃……对不起，{$P$}！\n我完全想不出帅气的歌词！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "14546ae7bebf0c17af73c0522dd28a2a186c63ca58c1f045017d2d7327b2d855", "ja": "いやー、全力でバカンスを楽しんでみたものの、\nいろいろやりすぎちゃったみたいでさ……。", "zh": "就是──我虽然全心全意享受了这个假期，\n但好像各方面的体验都太丰富了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "c6c198536281c9491d7eeb9f9c87d89e7049bf81edaaff02947d2a3af1da5c81", "ja": "何を書けばいいのか、わからなくなっちゃって。", "zh": "结果完全不知道该写什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e2cfd06c8e6770274c2252779ab035e1953389ae5a67f3733e6b92a906be0295", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\n経験の量が逆に仇になった、という事か……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n经验的量过多反倒不好发挥的意思吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4bb2b7b466bd32cec7755ec3dad5bf691af4f784323a3fc6373133e81b30b824", "ja": "しかし、どうしたものかな。\n旅行を延長するわけにはいかないし……。", "zh": "不过，这下该怎么办才好呢。\n毕竟也不可能延长旅程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2c6aca9527dae5168461fcc7f6142bc3fe155bfc1ce5b698fda63aa271bd764f", "ja": "それで、昨夜、3人で話し合ってみたんです。\n歌詞の内容をどうしようかって。", "zh": "所以，关于歌词内容该怎么办，\n昨天晚上我们三个一起讨论过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "624f48ed9e5616e9142454a03865c79951f52958c6b6ebec7e1297a49379a12d", "ja": "だったら、この最高だったバカンスを\nまるごと全部、歌詞にしてみたらどうかなって！", "zh": "我们就想，既然如此，\n要不要干脆把这次美好的假期全写进歌词里呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4cdc83e677dd3f9d4ffc5f227b2563065aa8c94e21cd3b7442d6cf022c9c810c", "ja": "まるごと全部……？", "zh": "全写进去……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f01ee7644b4f2cf2dec9179e994c2749e6b1e870872291f9f43d97f06df88203", "ja": "はい♪　なんかゴチャゴチャしちゃいそうですけど、\nそういうのも面白いかな～って♪", "zh": "没错♪虽然可能会变成东讲一点西讲一点，\n但这种歌词好像也很有趣～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "ca11dafa86dd4ef91ed893e844394c32b5089d6062961ee14859d769875040a0", "ja": "私たち、飛行機に乗る前からずっとワクワクしてて。\n着いてからは、ずーっと楽しいことしかないんです！", "zh": "我们从搭上飞机前就一直很期待。\n抵达目的地后，更是从头玩到了尾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "8edf4fd29a5ebe8f0b9db9aa758b5b3da658d56ba235c98e99d43cd080e8461c", "ja": "だから、どれかひとつを選んじゃったら、\nうまく伝わらないかもって思ったんだ。", "zh": "所以要是只挑其中一段来写，\n感觉就没办法好好表达我们的想法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "a276694d33da4e595fdbd7b3495b80ad39c45b157052914b1b41ca4d6e3bef9a", "ja": "アタシ達の「楽しい」を全部、みんなに\n伝えたい！って……そういうの、ダメかな？", "zh": "我们想把旅程中所有的「快乐」都传达给大家知道！\n……可以这样做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "dde6bdecfe8132f412f20c597613ada82dee7ea1ac0928e14d35285b13575ef2", "ja": "うん……いいんじゃないか？　それが3人の\n素直な想いなら、ファンの人にも届くと思う。", "zh": "嗯……这也不错吧？如果这就是你们发自内心的想法，\n我想粉丝们也会感受到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "6d6bb2b0a3e557ab1d3c9abe2c66c504ac5ebaddc1fdc7c5889ea4b7e05caa18", "ja": "へへ……♪\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "edc33a573f8869a583a39b7f464ea219242bf60dabcfb900dd655608392973bb", "ja": "よ～し、そうと決まればあとは作るだけだ！\n日本に帰ったらがんばるぞー！", "zh": "好～既然决定了，剩下的就只有写出来！\n回到日本后要加油啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5ef339f570fd4f83474d0ea3ac4203b6bf9692df0ac694b1a9927ec894434399", "ja": "（「楽しい」を全部……か。悪くないな。\nこの3人なら、きっと伝えられるはずだ！）", "zh": "（旅程中所有的「快乐」吗……也不错呢。\n如果是她们三个，一定可以好好传递出去的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
